.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Analyze one Song Meter WAV with Birda and enrich its detection CSV\&. 

Reads PREFIX_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS\&.wav and the recorder's summary one directory above the WAV directory\&. Updates the sibling \&.BirdNET\&.results\&.csv with coordinates, recording-local detection times, and the host timezone\&. The Birda invocation uses the CPU, a 0\&.50 confidence threshold, and the recorder's latitude/longitude\&. The generated CSV is replaced atomically after its rows have been validated and enriched\&. 
.PP
\fBCommand line\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
python3 birda_process_wav\&.py [--skip-existing-csv] recording\&.wav

.fi
.PP
 
.RE
.PP
\fBRequired recording layout\fP
.RS 4
A recording such as Track/Data/4952_20260126_201400\&.wav must have Track/4952_Summary\&.txt beside the Data directory\&. The summary must contain DATE, TIME, LAT, NS, LON, and EW columns\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBbirda_process_loop\&.py\fP 
.RE
.PP

